{"c":[{"id":"d3a518852906da6f","sum":"Local tox: run-parallel, session fixture. PR CI is .github/workflows/pr.yaml (py311–py314); main is ci.yaml plus coverage. tox-speedup archived; PR #65 closed #63.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T020911Z-dc61c4600974926c","text":"PR checks are .github/workflows/pr.yaml (tox py311-py314). Main CI is .github/workflows/ci.yaml (same matrix plus coverage upload).","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T021234Z-bd17f467296b95fc","text":"tox-speedup archived: local tox run-parallel, session summem fixture, PR/ci workflow split. Draft PR #65 closes #63.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"4ef12b6001b08fed","sum":"Each tox env is pytest -n auto --maxprocesses=4; coverage stays serial; 0 serial markers; PR #66 closes #64.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260826T024233Z-b9bc41aef5017da0","text":"Each tox env runs pytest -n auto --maxprocesses=4; coverage stays serial. Serial markers: 0. Unbounded auto made tox run-parallel slower.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T030409Z-e8788d730d1e85ab","text":"pytest-xdist archived: each tox env is -n auto --maxprocesses=4; 0 serial markers; PR #66 closes #64.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
